  "body": "[§4.8.16](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#mathml)’s support bar claims that MathML support is available in Chrome 24 and later. However, Can I Use notes that ‘Support was added in Chrome 24, but removed afterwards due to instability’ and Chrome is ‘No longer pursuing’ support. The support bar should indicate that Chrome does not currently support MathML.",
